        "official_en_sha256": "19833dc7dd32f44595bfcfa8b4e77faee790d99b58d764e01c9366282874bf0e"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あいつは汚い手を使う。\r\nどこかに罠を仕掛けてるかもしれない。",
        "official_en": "And she’s accustomed to fighting underhanded. She has likely set a trap or two.",
        "real_en": "She fights dirty. She may have set traps somewhere."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
