      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "うまくやれば俺も\r\n兄上みたいになれるかもしれない……。",
        "official_en": "If I cast it just right, maybe I can become more like you...",
        "real_en": "If I do it right, maybe I can become like you, Aniue..."
